^orange;Combos^reset;
---------------
Each strike of a combo, whether or not it hits a target, consumes 1% of your energy. If your energy is expended, you will no longer be able to combo and will instead perform frenzied normal attacks.
Be warned, tactics involving stun-locking enemies are no longer as viable.

Many weapons with combos provide additional bonuses when striking with these combos.

